{"articleNo":"544387","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=544387&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 서울고용노동청과 함께하는 취업준비콘서트_일자리톡톡[LIG넥스원] 홍보","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.11.17","hit":"4496","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 11.68px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. 서울지방고용노동청에서는&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">대기업은 적합한 구직자 매칭 및 청년층 대상의 대외 홍보</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">효과를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">지역청년</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">들은</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">해당</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">기업의</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">인재상</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">을</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">사전에</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">파악하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">실질적인 취업준비를 할 수 있는</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">중요한</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">기회를</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.75pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">제공하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.35pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">위해</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2025</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.75pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">지역청년들을</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">위한</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.85pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">대기업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.85pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&amp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">우수기업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">직무설명회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">_</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">서울고용노동청과</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">함께하는</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.95pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: blue; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">취업준비콘서트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">_</span><span style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">일자리</span><span style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: -0.95pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">톡톡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(Talk</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Talk)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">」</span></b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">을</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.75pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">진행합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. 위와 관련하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">아래와</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">같이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">취업준비콘서트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">_</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">일자리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">톡톡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(Talk</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Talk)_</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(48, 87, 185); font-size: 14pt;\">[LIG</span><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 87, 185);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">넥스원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">]</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">을</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">개최하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">,</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.85pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">많은</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">청년들이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">참석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">주시기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">바랍니다</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\">&nbsp;1) 일시 : 2025. 11.19.(수)</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\">&nbsp;2) 진행기업 : LIG넥스원</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\">&nbsp;3) 내용:&nbsp; 회사소개 / 인재상, 조직문화 / 채용프로세스&nbsp; 및 직무 / Q&amp;A&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\">&nbsp;4) 장소 및 시간 : 서울고용노동청 1층 청년 ON라운지 14:00~16:00</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\">&nbsp;5) 신청방법: 포스터내 QR코드로 사전신청&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4px;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoEZsh1AUgcQM4FE